Students must be able to register, sign-in, sign-out and authenticate the input.
Learners must be able to create, view, edit , complete and delete tasks.
Learners must be able to book support sessions.
The Dashboard should have progress calculations.
Learners should be able to search, filter and sort on tasks.
Cookie-based preference such as theme, display mode or last selected filter. Passwords and sensitive
data may not be stored in cookies.
Learners should be able to play a mini-game with score tracking.
There should be a printable progress summary. 
There should be at least one animation driven by JavaScript timers and one controlled multimedia element.